   "video_end": 10306.947,
   "notes": [
    "<p>Mayor Guthrie provided opening remarks regarding the 2026 Budget Update - Delegations.</p>\n<p>The following delegates spoke:<br/>Melissa Kwiatkowski and Kristin Kerr, Guelph Community Health Centre and Stonehenge Therapeutic<br/>Perrin Valli, Stepping Stone and Royal City Mission<br/>Scarlett Raczycki and Steve Donnelly, Arts and Culture Advisory Committee<br/>Preetam Sengupta<br/>Claire Cowan, Guelph Tool Library <br/>Meera Dyer, Wolfond Park Stewards<br/>Cyndy McLean<br/>Lee Kapuscinski, Mark Walton and Dr. Alexander Ferguson, Guelph General Hospital and Guelph Family Health Team Physician Recruiter Proposal<br/>Margaret Middleton, Rickson Park Stewards<br/>Meghan Lewis, Springdale Park Stewards<br/>Virginia Anderson, Guelph Community for Active Transportation<br/>Andrea Bidgood, BYCS<br/>Sonya Ogilvie<br/>James Fedosov<br/>Steven Petric, Transit Action Alliance of Guelph<br/>Mary Ann Burrows<br/>Greg Hines<br/>Martin Collier, Residents for a Safe Speedvale Avenue<br/>Carolyn McLeod-McCarthy, Guelph Food Bank<br/>Shubham Savaliya, Conestoga Students Inc.<br/>Alec Purves<br/>Scott Frederick</p>\n<p>The following delegates did not speak:<br/>Nathan Lawr<br/>Ed Gordon, Ed Video Media Arts Centre<br/>Alex Della Sciucca<br/>Claire Braden</p>\n<p>Council recessed (8:06 p.m.). Council reconvened (8:21 p.m.).</p>"
   ],
